 "html_content": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>A clearer first step toward your next home</title></head><body style=\"margin:0;background:#f1f4f8;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;mso-hide:all\">Explore your mortgage options at your pace.</div><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background:#f1f4f8\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:24px 12px\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"600\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:600px;background:#fff\"><tr><td style=\"padding:24px 30px;border-top:5px solid #0BFF56\"><a href=\"https://www.gorealo.com/\"><img src=\"https://pemcerts.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/gorealo-logo-lightmode.png\" width=\"154\" alt=\"GoRealo\" style=\"display:block;width:154px;max-width:100%;height:auto;border:0\"></a><p style=\"margin:9px 0 0;color:#667085;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1.5px\">MORTGAGE OPTIONS, MADE CLEAR</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:30px;background:#f0f5ff\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#003FDA;font-size:11px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:2px\">YOUR NEXT CHAPTER</p><h1 style=\"font-size:30px;line-height:1.2;margin:0 0 16px;color:#162849\">Let’s make your next move feel simpler.</h1><p style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#374151;margin:0 0 14px\">Hi {{first_name}}, buying a home can bring a lot of questions. Start with the ones that matter to you, and we’ll help you understand the options.</p></div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:22px 30px;background:#ffffff\"><div style=\"margin-bottom:14px\"><h2 style=\"font-size:26px;line-height:1.25;margin:0 0 8px;color:#162849\">Here&rsquo;s today&rsquo;s live rate snapshot</h2></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:14px\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border:1px solid #e5eaf1;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden\"><tr style=\"background:#f4f6f9\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;color:#667085;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px\">Loan Type</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;color:#667085;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px\">Interest Rate</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;color:#667085;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px\">APR</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:22px 30px;background:#f0f5ff\"><div style=\"margin-bottom:14px\"><p style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#162849;font-weight:bold;margin:0\">What are you hoping your next home makes possible?</p><p style=\"margin:20px 0 0\"><img src=\"https://app.gorealo.org/email-template-previews/gorealo/assets/hero.webp\" alt=\"GoRealo: Customer welcome\" width=\"540\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:540px;height:auto;border:0;border-radius:8px\"></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:22px 30px\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tr><td style=\"padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e5eaf1\"><h2 style=\"font-size:17px;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 7px;color:#162849\">Start with your plans</h2><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#4b5563;margin:0\">Tell us where you hope to buy, when you might move, and what a comfortable monthly payment looks like.</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e5eaf1\"><h2 style=\"font-size:17px;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 7px;color:#162849\">Get a useful next step</h2><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#4b5563;margin:0\">A quick conversation can help you decide whether to compare programs, explore payments, or begin an application.</p></td></tr></table><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#374151;margin:22px 0\">Reply with your timeline or your biggest question and a GoRealo team member can point you in the right direction.</p><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#374151\">Warmly,<br><strong>The GoRealo Team</strong></p><table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"margin:22px 0\"><tr><td bgcolor=\"#003FDA\" style=\"border-radius:4px\"><a href=\"https://www.gorealo.com/apply-now\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:14px 24px;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold\">Explore loan options</a></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\" style=\"height:12px;font-size:0\">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td bgcolor=\"#111827\" style=\"border-radius:4px\"><a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/gorealo/id6753648823\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:14px 24px;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold\">Download on the App Store</a></td><td style=\"width:12px;font-size:0\">&nbsp;</td><td bgcolor=\"#003FDA\" style=\"border-radius:4px\"><a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.gorealo\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:14px 24px;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold\">Get it on Google Play</a></td></tr></table><p style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:#667085\">Prefer to talk? Call <a href=\"tel:+18667139292\" style=\"color:#003FDA\">1-866-713-9292</a> or reply to this email.</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:20px 30px;background:#f4f6f9\"><p style=\"font-size:11px;line-height:1.7;color:#667085;margin:0\">GoRealo® is a DBA of Consumer Credit Services, LLC. NMLS #1070755 · Florida Mortgage Broker License #MBR1434.<br>5011 Gate Parkway Bldg 100, Suite 100, Jacksonville, FL 32256.<br>Equal Housing Opportunity. Credit, collateral, eligibility, and program terms apply.</p><p style=\"font-size:11px;line-height:1.7;color:#667085\"><a href=\"https://www.gorealo.com/privacy-policy/\" style=\"color:#003FDA\">Privacy</a> · <a href=\"{{unsubscribe_url}}\" style=\"color:#003FDA\">Unsubscribe</a></p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>\n",
 "plain_text_content": "A clearer first step toward your next home Explore your mortgage options at your pace. MORTGAGE OPTIONS, MADE CLEAR YOUR NEXT CHAPTER Let’s make your next move feel simpler. Hi {{first_name}}, buying a home can bring a lot of questions. Start with the ones that matter to you, and we’ll help you understand the options. Here&rsquo;s today&rsquo;s live rate snapshot Loan Type Interest Rate APR What are you hoping your next home makes possible? Start with your plans Tell us where you hope to buy, when you might move, and what a comfortable monthly payment looks like. Get a useful next step A quick conversation can help you decide whether to compare programs, explore payments, or begin an application. Reply with your timeline or your biggest question and a GoRealo team member can point you in the right direction. Warmly, The GoRealo Team Explore loan options &nbsp; Download on the App Store &nbsp; Get it on Google Play Prefer to talk? Call 1-866-713-9292 or reply to this email. GoRealo® is a DBA of Consumer Credit Services, LLC. NMLS #1070755 · Florida Mortgage Broker License #MBR1434. 5011 Gate Parkway Bldg 100, Suite 100, Jacksonville, FL 32256. Equal Housing Opportunity. Credit, collateral, eligibility, and program terms apply. Privacy · Unsubscribe",
